  "term": "nostalgia",
  "definition": "Nostalgia is a mixed emotional experience in which thinking about the past brings warm, valued memories along with a mild sense of sadness. It often centers on loved ones or meaningful events and can increase positive feelings while a person reflects on those earlier experiences.",
